    "Count the KitchenUtensils ladle as one spoon. Exclude the two spatulas and the whisk from fork/knife/spoon counts.",
    "Tableware contains five flat plates, not five bowls or cups. SeasoningBox has lidded spice canisters, not drinking cups or narrow-neck bottles.",
    "CookingBench is a two-burner gas cooktop without an oven chamber; it is neither a seating bench nor a physical oven under this policy.",
    "Vase is one decorative vase; cut stems are not a potted plant. Tablets are not laptops or cell phones. The included FitnessEquipment geometry is one weight bench with rack, counted as bench; no bicycle is present. The separately placed Dumbbell assembly does not create another bench.",
    "Printed people, animals and objects in portrait textures are depictions, not additional physical COCO instances."
